        "ROB_BELMONT_BODY_TYPHOON_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "Kiel <color=#3060FF>Belmont</color>, venku la ludon aux ekstermigxu je Typhoon aux Eclipse.",
